{
  "id": "ss.relic.compass",
  "name": "Compass antenna",
  "description": "Two feelers off a small dark head at the bottom of the plate, a long one that swings out left and comes back over the top and a shorter one that climbs straight up the right, both ending aimed at the same pink mote up in the corner. The mote is a ruin's scent and the feelers are the needle: this relic makes ruins turn up more often, and answer with a curse more often, so the pink is the hive's own colour and not a friendly one. The antennae are tapered solid curves with a bead at the joint rather than lines, because two thin lines meeting at a point are a chevron; the head is a plain dome with no eyes, because a head with eyes would make the icon a face and not an instrument.",
